WEBVTT

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:18.018
<i>Connecting...</i>

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.436
to the Heigus particle well.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.981
Beam emitter, activate.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.401
Target locked.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.570
Gravitational beam emitter...

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.030
fire.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.712
Test successful.

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:48.590
All matter within 100 kilometers

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:51.969
of the beam trajectory
has been vaporized.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:54.846
Captain?

00:00:56.932 --> 00:00:58.767
Spectacular.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.895
Yes.

00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:08.402
It is powerful.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.904
Yes, even more so than we thought.

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:13.365
I am ending the test.

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:17.536
Numi, please disconnect the beam emitter
from the Heigus particle well.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:18.662
<i>Copy that.</i>

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.459
What?

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:29.298
Captain.

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:31.717
-What is it?
-Numi. What's happening?

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:34.553
<i>I am unable to disconnect
<i>the Heigus current.</i></i>

00:01:34.845 --> 00:01:35.846
What did you say?

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:39.016
<i>The Beam Emitter is not
<i>receiving our commands.</i></i>

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:42.519
<i>It is continuing to extract
<i>Heigus particles from the well.</i></i>

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:43.812
No...

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:06.585
<i>Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light!</i></i>

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:15.886
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:22.643
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:26.813
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:36.740
<i>Our only haven is this fortress</i>

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.826
<i>Wandering among the stars</i>

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:43.080
<i>Where we tremble with impatience</i>

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:45.499
<i>Between life and death</i>

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:51.254
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:56.093
<i>Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:04.226
<i>Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here</i></i>

00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:10.941
<i>Carry within ourselves the will to fight</i>

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:14.569
<i>Our lives shine their brightest</i>

00:03:14.653 --> 00:03:17.072
<i>In the defense of love</i>

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:21.034
<i>We boldly enter the fray</i>

00:03:21.118 --> 00:03:25.539
<i>The Knights of Sidonia</i>

00:03:32.963 --> 00:03:35.465
RUMBLING

00:03:37.342 --> 00:03:38.719
WARNING - GRAVITATIONAL
ABNORMALITY DETECTED

00:03:38.927 --> 00:03:39.970
What is going on?

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.264
Gravitational disturbances are being
reported in sections of the ship.

00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:43.640
Gravitational disturbance?

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.102
<i>Gravity warning,
<i>this is a gravity warning.</i></i>

00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:49.813
<i>Gravitational disturbances have
<i>been reported within the ship.</i></i>

00:03:50.021 --> 00:03:53.442
<i>All hands, secure your gravity belts,
<i>and prepare for the gravity disturbance.</i></i>

00:03:53.608 --> 00:03:55.861
Tanikaze, Tanikaze.

00:03:57.404 --> 00:03:58.739
Something has happened.

00:04:00.449 --> 00:04:01.491
What is it?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.495
No disturbances reported
in the civilian residential districts.

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:09.291
No reports of abnormalities
in the military or industrial districts.

00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:11.793
There are no signs of an outside attack.

00:04:12.127 --> 00:04:14.087
Probationary subcommander,
please take a look at this.

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.130
What?

00:04:15.213 --> 00:04:18.592
This is the asteroid
that was drifting near Sidonia.

00:04:19.009 --> 00:04:22.137
There appears to be a cylindrical
hole through it, 200 kilometers wide.

00:04:22.471 --> 00:04:25.348
No debris detected around the asteroid.

00:04:25.682 --> 00:04:27.142
What is going on?

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.519
What caused the gravitational
disturbance?

00:04:29.728 --> 00:04:31.021
Do we not know yet?

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:32.397
At the time of the disturbance,

00:04:32.481 --> 00:04:35.567
intense tremors were detected
near the rear outer shell.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.319
-Put it on the monitor.
-Actually...

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:39.446
all information from
that district has been

00:04:39.529 --> 00:04:41.782
restricted to the highest level
of clearance.

00:04:42.407 --> 00:04:45.410
Top-level security clearance? Wait.

00:04:47.704 --> 00:04:49.122
We have no choice.

00:04:49.498 --> 00:04:51.166
Issue orders to the garde
squad immediately.

00:04:51.249 --> 00:04:53.168
Deploy all on-duty units now.

00:04:53.627 --> 00:04:55.545
Then select 20 pilots

00:04:56.004 --> 00:04:58.173
and put them on standby
with the hybrid Tsumugi.

00:04:58.256 --> 00:04:59.090
Copy that.

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:06.681
You both received emergency standby
orders. What could have happened?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:09.476
I don't know, but we should go.

00:05:10.185 --> 00:05:11.812
Be careful, Nagate.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.313
You too, Tsumugi.

00:05:13.396 --> 00:05:16.024
Yes, you be careful too, Izana.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.278
All right, we'll be back.

00:05:22.614 --> 00:05:23.657
Be safe.

00:05:31.957 --> 00:05:34.709
Numi, you have to regain control.

00:05:34.793 --> 00:05:35.919
Numi?

00:05:39.631 --> 00:05:41.841
I'm going to cut off
the Heigus particle well.

00:05:50.559 --> 00:05:52.143
Another failed attempt.

00:05:58.567 --> 00:06:01.486
It is too dangerous here.
Captain, we must evacuate.

00:06:16.668 --> 00:06:18.044
<i>This is Unit 203.</i>

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.421
I see something.

00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:24.509
It's a gauna.

00:06:25.176 --> 00:06:26.219
<i>It's a gauna.</i>

00:06:26.678 --> 00:06:29.097
<i>The gauna is eating away
<i>the outer shell.</i></i>

00:06:30.599 --> 00:06:32.767
<i>It's wrapped its tentacles
<i>around Sidonia.</i></i>

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.853
How did it go unnoticed?

00:06:35.145 --> 00:06:36.396
What's going on with
the surveillance network?

00:06:36.688 --> 00:06:37.814
I don't know.

00:06:38.023 --> 00:06:40.358
There is no indication
where the gauna came from.

00:06:40.775 --> 00:06:42.068
What district is this?

00:06:43.528 --> 00:06:45.822
It's Kunato Developments'
prototype weapons arsenal.

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:49.159
So much of it is classified,
there's no telling what's inside.

00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:52.370
Well, that complicates things.

00:06:52.996 --> 00:06:54.831
We can't carelessly attack in there.

00:06:55.957 --> 00:06:58.001
In that case, evacuate all personnel

00:06:58.084 --> 00:07:01.588
within a one kilometer radius
of the affected district.

00:07:01.796 --> 00:07:02.797
Copy that.

00:07:06.134 --> 00:07:07.302
What is this?

00:07:07.677 --> 00:07:09.137
What in the hell is going on?

00:07:09.638 --> 00:07:11.473
Why aren't they telling us anything?

00:07:11.848 --> 00:07:13.725
<i>All selected pilots have finished
<i>boarding their garde units.</i></i>

00:07:13.808 --> 00:07:15.560
<i>They are currently on standby
<i>and ready to deploy.</i></i>

00:07:22.817 --> 00:07:24.945
Where are you going,
Professor Shinatose?

00:07:25.403 --> 00:07:28.531
We need to stop
the Heigus gravity well.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:29.991
Please, let me go.

00:07:30.825 --> 00:07:31.868
No.

00:07:32.327 --> 00:07:35.705
Our orders are to evacuate this area.
Please, you have to evacuate.

00:07:39.417 --> 00:07:41.336
This piece of...

00:07:41.962 --> 00:07:43.505
<i>There is another casualty.</i>

00:07:43.964 --> 00:07:45.840
<i>And the damage from
<i>the tentacles is spreading.</i></i>

00:07:46.216 --> 00:07:48.426
<i>Please. Allow me to attack.</i>

00:07:48.718 --> 00:07:50.553
I guess we have no choice.

00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:52.681
I'll take responsibility.

00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:54.516
-You have my permission to engage.
<i>-Copy that.</i>

00:07:54.933 --> 00:07:56.226
All units, attack.

00:07:56.685 --> 00:07:57.978
Copy that.

00:08:08.947 --> 00:08:11.574
This is a direct order from command.
Please fall back.

00:08:11.658 --> 00:08:13.576
We don't have time for this.

00:08:13.994 --> 00:08:15.203
I need to go now.

00:08:19.416 --> 00:08:21.042
It's no use.

00:08:21.584 --> 00:08:24.254
We're detecting a sudden rise in Heigus
particle concentration in the target area.

00:08:24.462 --> 00:08:25.630
Abnormal gravity field detected.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:28.216
It's at the same level of the previous
gravitational disturbance.

00:08:28.299 --> 00:08:30.760
Is this--? Oh, no.

00:08:31.136 --> 00:08:32.887
All units, pull back. Hurry.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.747
We've lost Unit 203's signal.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.458
We've also lost the signal
from Unit 177.

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:04.753
Unit 097, come in. Unit 097.

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:08.048
There has been an explosion.
We don't know its cause.

00:09:08.256 --> 00:09:09.924
Explosion? What about the gauna?

00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:13.053
We've lost its signal.
There's no trace of it.

00:09:13.178 --> 00:09:14.429
It seems to have been vaporized.

00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:15.680
<i>Vaporized?</i>

00:09:16.264 --> 00:09:18.975
<i>What is going on?</i>

00:09:19.517 --> 00:09:21.978
<i>This is Samari.
<i>What was that explosion?</i></i>

00:09:22.312 --> 00:09:23.480
<i>Can we deploy now?</i>

00:09:23.813 --> 00:09:25.148
Launch the garde squad.

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:28.485
Tanikaze's team and Samari's team
will search for the missing gauna.

00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:30.820
All other teams, get to the scene
and rescue any survivors.

00:09:30.904 --> 00:09:32.697
We're getting a visual
of the area of the explosion.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.136
<i>Situation assessment is your top priority.</i>

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.055
<i>Concentrate your search
<i>to the selected area.</i></i>

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:59.516
Team Tanikaze has arrived
at the scene of the explosion.

00:10:00.892 --> 00:10:04.312
<i>Unknown damage to the classified
<i>area around the source of the explosion.</i></i>

00:10:04.395 --> 00:10:07.190
<i>We are now compiling a damage report
<i>for the entire Outer Wall District 14.</i></i>

00:10:07.273 --> 00:10:09.859
<i>Emergency barriers have been
<i>activated in over 100 districts.</i></i>

00:10:10.235 --> 00:10:12.862
<i>Prioritize rescue efforts
<i>around the closed areas.</i></i>

00:10:12.946 --> 00:10:15.240
Team Tanikaze will now search for

00:10:15.323 --> 00:10:17.575
the missing gauna around
the scene of the explosion.

00:10:17.742 --> 00:10:19.452
<i>Close the barrier. Hurry.</i>

00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:21.579
<i>Someone's trapped here.</i>

00:10:30.588 --> 00:10:36.469
SITES OF SIDONIA
TANIKAZE RESIDENCE

00:10:36.928 --> 00:10:40.682
<i>It has been determined that
<i>a gauna attack was the cause of</i></i>

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:44.102
<i>yesterday's gravitational disturbances,
<i>as well as the subsequent explosion.</i></i>

00:10:44.185 --> 00:10:48.106
<i>It is believed the gauna hid in a drifting
<i>asteroid before flying to our ship.</i></i>

00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:50.316
<i>By the time the garde squad arrived,</i>

00:10:50.692 --> 00:10:53.069
<i>it appears the gauna self-destructed.</i>

00:11:00.326 --> 00:11:03.204
The gravitational beam emitter.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:06.666
One of the weapon designs
extracted from Ochiai's auxiliary brain.

00:11:06.749 --> 00:11:08.459
Exceptionally powerful.

00:11:08.543 --> 00:11:12.463
It is one of the designs Ochiai
spent hundreds of years researching,

00:11:12.797 --> 00:11:15.091
but still failed to complete.

00:11:15.633 --> 00:11:19.262
We used ena to complete the engine design
which was thought impossible to make.

00:11:19.554 --> 00:11:22.724
As a result, we're mostly unsure of

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:25.268
what is going on
within its internal structure.

00:11:27.854 --> 00:11:30.356
As long as we have to rely
on the ena for its development,

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.234
we will not be able to prevent
further accidents like yesterday's.

00:11:33.902 --> 00:11:35.194
It was a failure.

00:11:35.653 --> 00:11:38.364
No. Continue with the plan.

00:11:38.615 --> 00:11:39.741
What?

00:11:39.824 --> 00:11:43.161
We must be able to control it.

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:44.746
But, ma'am...

00:11:46.998 --> 00:11:48.499
It is a spectacular weapon.

00:11:49.334 --> 00:11:51.502
It will be of use to us.

00:11:54.047 --> 00:11:55.089
Understood.

00:11:58.509 --> 00:11:59.510
This way.

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:04.098
It's a prototype for
an autonomous garde support unit.

00:12:04.182 --> 00:12:05.224
It's very big.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.854
It will be able to link
four garde units within its armor.

00:12:10.063 --> 00:12:11.147
So it combines?

00:12:11.731 --> 00:12:13.566
I said it links.

00:12:15.777 --> 00:12:18.905
Is that man-made kabi at the ends?

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:20.990
That's right.

00:12:21.282 --> 00:12:23.826
A clasp-formation armor...

00:12:24.243 --> 00:12:27.372
equipped with man-made kabi
at its tips?

00:12:28.081 --> 00:12:30.792
We plan on modifying
the pilot suits soon as well.

00:12:31.542 --> 00:12:33.002
Oh, and here.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.050
What's this?

00:12:40.134 --> 00:12:43.221
It's a katana made
from scraps of man-made kabi.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.766
Well, I doubt you'll ever actually use it.

00:12:46.849 --> 00:12:48.351
Think of it as a good luck charm.

00:12:50.311 --> 00:12:51.312
Here.

00:12:52.772 --> 00:12:54.774
Here, En, Ren.

00:13:01.823 --> 00:13:03.408
Thanks, Tanikaze.

00:13:04.075 --> 00:13:05.368
Uh, sure.

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:16.796
<i>Now we can rush at the gauna, huh?</i>

00:13:20.925 --> 00:13:22.135
Shinatose?

00:13:22.218 --> 00:13:23.845
<i>It's been a long time, Sasaki.</i>

00:13:23.928 --> 00:13:25.096
Yeah, it sure has.

00:13:25.346 --> 00:13:26.347
<i>I need your advice.</i>

00:13:27.223 --> 00:13:28.307
My advice?

00:13:35.815 --> 00:13:40.403
You still haven't apologized to Tanikaze
for punching him the other day, right?

00:13:41.195 --> 00:13:44.449
No. I haven't found the right
opportunity to bring it up.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:49.120
The longer you wait,
the less of an opportunity you'll have.

00:13:49.704 --> 00:13:54.333
I know. Tanikaze is supposed to be on duty
today. He should be in the ready room.

00:13:54.417 --> 00:13:55.501
What?

00:13:55.585 --> 00:13:59.213
I bet he'd appreciate it if you
brought him something to eat.

00:14:00.548 --> 00:14:03.009
Something to eat?

00:14:18.566 --> 00:14:19.609
All right...

00:14:38.169 --> 00:14:39.962
Tanikaze, you got a moment?

00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:41.464
Yes, of course.

00:14:42.215 --> 00:14:43.216
What is it?

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:45.301
Sorry.

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:48.513
Could you come with me
after you're relieved?

00:14:49.764 --> 00:14:50.890
Oh, okay.

00:14:51.682 --> 00:14:53.184
I can do that.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.438
NEGIKUJIRA

00:15:00.316 --> 00:15:02.235
Gravity oden, huh?

00:15:04.487 --> 00:15:07.490
There's so much food
I've still never heard of.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.117
It's so good.

00:15:11.411 --> 00:15:12.995
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:15:14.497 --> 00:15:16.541
I got distracted by all this food.

00:15:17.542 --> 00:15:18.918
What were we talking about?

00:15:23.131 --> 00:15:25.258
Oh, that's right. Piloting.

00:15:25.591 --> 00:15:28.803
Oh, I mean, you are
a much better pilot than me.

00:15:28.886 --> 00:15:30.179
Me?

00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:35.184
Forget my piloting. I haven't even been
able to issue any decent orders.

00:15:35.852 --> 00:15:39.021
You and Tsumugi saved us...

00:15:40.273 --> 00:15:44.735
The fighting will only get worse
once we enter the Lem Star System.

00:15:46.279 --> 00:15:49.115
I realized something after
seeing that new garde weapon.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:52.410
The captain plans
to fight the gauna cluster.

00:15:53.161 --> 00:15:55.455
I'll be ordering more of my team to...

00:15:56.038 --> 00:16:00.668
Whenever I start thinking about it, I get
frozen by fear, even during a mission.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.880
Damn it.

00:16:04.172 --> 00:16:06.591
Why did I tell you that?

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.554
If it weren't for you...

00:16:13.264 --> 00:16:17.143
I think that more pilots
would have lost their lives.

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:20.980
I will be here if you ever
need to talk to somebody.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.944
Thanks.

00:16:27.028 --> 00:16:28.696
Don't mention it.

00:16:37.622 --> 00:16:38.789
Tanikaze.

00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:41.709
I suddenly feel like...

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.879
photosynthesizing.

00:16:59.644 --> 00:17:02.146
Barkeep, give me another one.

00:17:07.902 --> 00:17:11.030
<i>We will be performing
<i>joint garde-squad drills.</i></i>

00:17:11.364 --> 00:17:13.491
<i>Pilots, board your units and stand by.</i>

00:17:13.574 --> 00:17:14.659
Izana.

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.872
Izana, you're still here?

00:17:20.289 --> 00:17:21.791
The drills are about to start.

00:17:21.874 --> 00:17:23.918
My pilot suit broke,

00:17:24.085 --> 00:17:26.128
and I can't get it to activate.

00:17:26.837 --> 00:17:29.131
<i>There is a possibility
<i>that it is a different user,</i></i>

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:31.926
<i>or the user has experienced
<i>a significant physiological change.</i></i>

00:17:32.009 --> 00:17:33.135
What?

00:17:33.344 --> 00:17:34.595
<i>The suit may rupture...</i>

00:17:34.679 --> 00:17:36.931
I'm telling you, it's me.

00:17:37.014 --> 00:17:38.474
<i>Suit access denied.</i>

00:17:38.558 --> 00:17:41.435
<i>Several irregular
<i>maintenance attempts detected.</i></i>

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:44.939
Irregular? You didn't try to fix
the pilot suit yourself, did you?

00:17:46.399 --> 00:17:48.442
<i>Pilots, board your units and stand by.</i>

00:17:48.693 --> 00:17:49.986
There's no time.

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:51.279
Come on. Let's go.

00:17:53.239 --> 00:17:54.365
Damn it.

00:17:54.448 --> 00:17:57.326
I guess I'll have to bypass
the interface and force it on.

00:17:57.702 --> 00:18:00.621
<i>Suit access granted,
<i>suit access granted...</i></i>

00:18:01.664 --> 00:18:03.583
<i>-Force cancel.
-What?</i>

00:18:04.125 --> 00:18:06.252
What?

00:18:07.253 --> 00:18:08.296
Nagate!

00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:23.060
What happened, you two?

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.564
Oh... nothing.

00:18:27.023 --> 00:18:28.733
Yeah, nothing.

00:18:32.987 --> 00:18:33.988
Who could that be?

00:18:35.698 --> 00:18:38.034
-Yuhata?
-What?

00:18:38.284 --> 00:18:40.786
-What are we going to do?
-Izana, we need to hide Tsumugi.

00:18:40.995 --> 00:18:42.204
Coming.

00:18:43.289 --> 00:18:44.290
No!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:55.051
Oh, you already knew.

00:18:55.343 --> 00:18:59.639
Don't worry, it's not like
you're under surveillance.

00:18:59.847 --> 00:19:02.391
Does that mean that I can...

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.603
go to other residential districts as well?

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:07.188
I'm sorry, Tsumugi.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.732
I can't allow you to do that yet.

00:19:10.274 --> 00:19:12.360
But as long as you don't do
anything to draw attention,

00:19:12.443 --> 00:19:14.320
you can still do what you've been doing.

00:19:14.945 --> 00:19:16.405
I understand.

00:19:16.489 --> 00:19:18.282
I was asking for too much.

00:19:18.366 --> 00:19:19.659
I'm sorry.

00:19:20.076 --> 00:19:21.702
Thank you, Yuhata.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.375
This is a nice place.

00:19:28.417 --> 00:19:32.046
I can't remember
the last time I've felt so relaxed.

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:36.342
I know!
Yuhata, you should spend the night.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:39.595
What? Are you sure I'm not intruding?

00:19:39.679 --> 00:19:40.763
Not at all.

00:19:40.846 --> 00:19:43.307
But I might have to be called in...

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:47.269
There's a direct elevator line
to the military district close by.

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:49.063
Are you sure you can't stay?

00:19:49.313 --> 00:19:52.775
And there's something
I wanted to talk to you about.

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:53.734
What?

00:19:58.364 --> 00:20:01.575
Izana. What are those?

00:20:01.784 --> 00:20:04.078
Not so loud, Yuhata.

00:20:08.666 --> 00:20:09.959
I see,

00:20:10.418 --> 00:20:12.336
so you decided to go that way.

00:20:12.753 --> 00:20:15.923
It's not like I made
a conscious decision.

00:20:16.716 --> 00:20:19.552
They are bigger than mine.

00:20:20.136 --> 00:20:23.472
Yuhata, yours get smaller
when you take off your clothes.

00:20:23.764 --> 00:20:26.308
What? Tsumugi.

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:31.439
Doesn't a middlesex individual's gender
change to correspond with a mate?

00:20:31.522 --> 00:20:32.815
What?

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.153
Since you've taken on
a female physiology,

00:20:37.319 --> 00:20:40.281
does that mean you've found
a suitable male mate?

00:20:41.115 --> 00:20:43.826
What are you talking about, Tsumugi?

00:20:44.285 --> 00:20:47.246
There's a lot of different
reasons why genders change.

00:20:48.831 --> 00:20:50.541
I'm getting out.

00:20:54.503 --> 00:20:57.465
Why did Izana get so upset?

00:20:57.798 --> 00:20:59.967
It's because I teased her.

00:21:09.059 --> 00:21:10.478
Watch it, Tsumugi.

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:12.188
Hey, Yuhata.

00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:13.939
Do you know how to play sevens?

00:21:14.023 --> 00:21:16.609
Sevens? Oh, yeah, I do.

00:21:18.068 --> 00:21:20.696
Let's all play when
we're done with our bath.

00:21:21.113 --> 00:21:23.365
I have a deck of cards.

00:21:24.408 --> 00:21:25.743
Okay.

00:21:25.826 --> 00:21:27.369
What?

00:21:28.454 --> 00:21:32.166
I won't be playing cards with you,
Nagate. Okay?

00:21:32.792 --> 00:21:35.127
<i>Ouch! That's hot!</i>

00:21:48.098 --> 00:21:51.560
<i>I wonder if the colony ship
<i>made it back to Sidonia safely.</i></i>

00:21:53.354 --> 00:21:55.523
If there's still a Sidonia to return to.

00:21:56.106 --> 00:21:58.734
Those fools.
Refusing to throw down their arms.

00:21:59.318 --> 00:22:02.363
Do they think there's still
a gauna threat around here?

00:22:02.822 --> 00:22:05.574
This is Planet Seven's Second
Satellite Base Headquarters.

00:22:05.658 --> 00:22:06.992
Come in, landing ship.

00:22:07.451 --> 00:22:08.494
Come in.

00:22:08.577 --> 00:22:11.121
<i>This is the landing ship. We hear you.</i>

00:22:11.205 --> 00:22:13.666
<i>We've landed safely.</i>

00:22:14.166 --> 00:22:15.668
<i>We were admiring the view.</i>

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:18.087
That sounds like fun. I'm jealous.

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:21.131
<i>Yes. It's a paradise down here...</i>

00:22:23.843 --> 00:22:24.718
What is it?

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:28.180
Hey, what's going on?

00:22:28.973 --> 00:22:30.849
What's wrong? Come in.

00:22:33.769 --> 00:22:37.147
<i>HQ, this is the landing party.
<i>This is an emergency.</i></i>

00:22:37.523 --> 00:22:38.566
<i>It's the gau--</i>

00:22:40.985 --> 00:22:42.444
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.907 --> 00:22:50.869
<i>Oh, if this world must decay</i>

00:22:50.953 --> 00:22:54.623
<i>And I'm destined to give my life away</i>

00:22:54.707 --> 00:22:59.795
<i>What should I be living for?</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:05.718
<i>If I had never met you</i>

00:23:05.801 --> 00:23:09.388
<i>I would never have known</i>

00:23:09.471 --> 00:23:15.394
<i>This pain that tears at my heart</i>

00:23:15.477 --> 00:23:17.813
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-Echoing there</i></i>

00:23:17.896 --> 00:23:19.898
<i>-Fortune
<i>-In the furthest reaches of the cosmos</i></i>

00:23:19.982 --> 00:23:22.901
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Is this clumsy requiem</i></i>

00:23:22.985 --> 00:23:25.279
<i>-To be the sport of fortune
<i>-And yet</i></i>

00:23:25.362 --> 00:23:27.197
<i>-Fortune
<i>-I'm still searching</i></i>

00:23:27.281 --> 00:23:30.618
<i>-Fortune
<i>-Within this uncertain reality</i></i>

00:23:31.201 --> 00:23:32.703
<i>For you</i>

00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:36.415
<i>The joy of our finding each other</i>

00:23:36.498 --> 00:23:40.127
<i>The vanished warmth</i>

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:43.839
<i>You should know that I remember it all</i>

00:23:43.922 --> 00:23:47.593
<i>Because I loved you</i>

00:23:47.676 --> 00:23:51.263
<i>The emotions that arise</i>

00:23:51.347 --> 00:23:54.892
<i>The scars left in my heart</i>

00:23:54.975 --> 00:23:59.313
<i>You should know that I'll carry them all</i>

00:23:59.396 --> 00:24:05.986
<i>As I walk this path</i>
